# The AI trading bot is a SEPARATE project that happens to live in this working
# tree. It has its own git repository in trading-bot/ and is destined for its
# own GitHub repo, so it is deliberately not tracked here -- this repo is an
# ffmpeg proxy, and mixing an unrelated trading system into its history (and
# into a public repo) is not wanted.
#
#   cd trading-bot && git log        # its own history lives there
#   git clone ai-trading-bot.bundle  # a complete clonable copy
trading-bot/
ai-trading-bot.bundle

# The AI revenue agency is likewise a SEPARATE project living in this working
# tree. It has its own git repository in revenue-agency/ and belongs in its own
# GitHub repo -- this repo is an ffmpeg proxy, and an unrelated sales-automation
# system does not belong in its history.
#
#   cd revenue-agency && git log            # its own history lives there
#   git clone revenue-agency.bundle         # a complete clonable copy
revenue-agency/
revenue-agency.bundle
